---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Travel Blog & Tips
description: Guides and how-tos about luggage, baggage fees, and packing.
---
<div class="prose mb-8">
  <h1>Travel Blog & Tips</h1>
  <p>Guides to pack lighter, avoid fees, and fly stress-free.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
{% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
  <article class="p-5 border rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="inline-block mt-3 text-blue-700 underline">Read</a>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
